    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "NextWave Consulting is a newly added row in the workbook: a boutique with UK and Netherlands presence whose Appian work sits in finance and model risk management. The tool column also records an Appian EMEA Innovation Award.\n\nThe record is deliberately thin. No capability gap has been researched for this lead, so there is no fit statement to make \u2014 only the placement: which platform, which domains, which geographies. Appian is a low-code platform, which puts the row in the same category as the Mendix and OutSystems leads in this corpus, where a platform already occupies the slot a record layer would fill.\n\nWhat makes the row worth keeping is the domain. Model risk management is a field where decisions are reviewed after the fact, which is where an attributed record has obvious value \u2014 but that is a hypothesis to test, not a finding, and the workbook's own priority of 'decide thesis first' says as much.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**2 \u00b7 decide thesis first**\n- NextWave Consulting (UK)\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> NEW. Boutique with UK and NL presence. Appian work in finance and model risk management.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:33:19.110335Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:33:19.110340Z"
    }
  },
